AGENTS.md stated 'There is no backend — all data is mock/computed locally',
which is wrong: installer/overlay/usr/lib/nexus/ contains ~1700 lines of
collectors that serve real cluster and host metrics on an installed node. It
also listed three themes that no longer exist (Emerald Console, Solar Flare),
claimed 41 tests, and documented admin/demo as the credentials.

Describe the live/demo split, the null-versus-zero metric contract, and the
real four themes. Test count is now 328 and there is no hardcoded default
password on an installed node.
